stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> OriginCreated: Node Generates Alert
    OriginCreated --> InCustody: Save to AlertCustodyStore
    
    InCustody --> Partitioned: No Direct Neighbors in Range
    Partitioned --> InCustody: Periodic Liveness Sweep

    InCustody --> NeighborConnected: New Neighbor Discovered
    NeighborConnected --> Replicating: Check deliveredNeighbors Map
    Replicating --> InCustody: Forward Alert & Add Neighbor to Delivered Set

    InCustody --> Expired: TTL Expired (24 Hours)
    Expired --> [*]: Purged from Custody Store